<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 13:50:08 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a8afa8a02252</link><description>&lt;p&gt;乌特勒支铁路博物馆里的旧旅游宣传单。其中有一份英文版的，标题是《如何游览荷兰》。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='old leaflets for tourists at the Utrecht Railway museum. This one is in English "How to See Holland". ' height="3302" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maaikees/6a8afa8a02252.jpg" width="4954"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maaikees.some.pics"&gt;@maaikees&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 13:50:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a8afa55bb3db</link><description>&lt;p&gt;蒸汽火车发动机的细节&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="detail of a steam train engine
the photo is focused on the red valve that is part of the engine, don't ask me what it does or how it works." height="3302" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maaikees/6a8afa55bb3db.jpg" width="4954"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maaikees.some.pics"&gt;@maaikees&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 13:49:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a8af9faaa128</link><description>&lt;p&gt;两列老火车，我不知道它们有多老，但我很喜欢它们！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="the front of one train on the left side of the photo (only the cockpit is visible) and a little more visible of another old train. I'm sorry I'm quite rubbish at describing this. Two old and beautifully preserved trains that were driven in the North of the Netherlands over one century ago. " height="3238" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maaikees/6a8af9faaa128.jpg" width="4856"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maaikees.some.pics"&gt;@maaikees&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 13:47:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a8af9b6b1cde</link><description>&lt;p&gt;那些曾经悬挂在荷兰火车站的老式出发指示牌（我清楚地记得，它们陪伴了我的青春岁月！），如今已退役，陈列在乌得勒支铁路博物馆中。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="an old departure sign that was common at Dutch stations, with an analogue clock next to it. " height="3302" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maaikees/6a8af9b6b1cde.jpg" width="4954"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maaikees.some.pics"&gt;@maaikees&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 13:46:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a8af998cdeba</link><description>&lt;p&gt;荷兰铁路标志&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Dutch Railway logo" height="3302" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maaikees/6a8af998cdeba.jpg" width="4954"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maaikees.some.pics"&gt;@maaikees&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 13:46:04 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>